Q2. Export your current Postman collection for a 'Movie Ticket Booking API' (with at least 2 requests: add movie, get movies) and share the exported JSON file with a classmate.

Steps:

1. Create a new collection named Movie Ticket Booking API.
2. Add Request 1:

POST /movies

Body:

{
    "title":"Jawan",
    "genre":"Action"
}

3. Add Request 2:

GET /movies

4. Click on the three dots (...) beside the collection name.
5. Select Export.
6. Choose Collection v2.1 format.
7. Save the JSON file.
8. Share the exported file with a classmate.